# Cloud AI tier ON (bonus R2-B1..B4). Mounted by docker-compose.azure-ai.yml over
# /etc/caddy/propertyscope-ai.caddy. The shared AI routes fall through to the nginx edge, and the
# @protected matcher in the Caddyfile still requires operator credentials for every AI and
# operations route except the public AI-mode health check.
respond /__propertyscope/ai-tier 204
